=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Apururu (A)} at (H-12).
** You'll need to speak to {p:Kupipi (A)} at (H-12) beforehand if you've never done so before.
* Next speak with {p:Kopuro-Popuro (A)} at (F-9) in the Western Encampment near Veridical Conflux #03.
* You'll be tasked with retrieving a {@k} {p:Ripe starfruit|Ripe starfruit (Abyssea)} from the **Bottomless Box** next to him, in order to do this however you must gain its affection.
** You're suggested to use various emotes such /cheer, /clap, /praise, /smile or /joy to gain the affection of the **Bottomless Box**.
*** Perform the suggested emotes from Kopuro-Popuro a few times over on the box in order to increase the chances of obtainment.
**** It is possible however, to receive the item without the use of emotes.
* Return to {p:Apururu (A)} to complete the quest.

